<00:39:55.690><ruby>เรา<rt>라오</rt></ruby> <00:39:56.350><ruby>ต้อง<rt>떵</rt></ruby> <00:39:56.770><ruby>ใช้<rt>차이</rt></ruby> <00:39:57.410><ruby>ความคิด<rt>쾀킷</rt></ruby> <00:39:57.910><ruby>ความ<rt>쾀</rt></ruby> <00:39:58.110><ruby>อ่าน<rt>안</rt></ruby> <00:39:58.370><ruby>ซี<rt>시</rt></ruby>
